<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>OxPHP Third-Party Licenses</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 60rem; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; line-height: 1.4; }
  h1 { border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc; padding-bottom: .3rem; }
  h2 { margin-top: 2rem; color: #333; }
  h3 { margin-top: 1.5rem; color: #555; }
  ul.crates { columns: 2; font-size: .9rem; padding-left: 1.2rem; }
  ul.crates li { break-inside: avoid; }
  pre { background: #f6f8fa; padding: 1rem; overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word; font-size: .85rem; }
  .spdx { color: #666; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: .85rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>OxPHP &mdash; Third-Party Licenses</h1>
<p>This document lists the licenses of all Rust crates linked into the OxPHP binary. OxPHP itself is licensed under AGPL-3.0; see the accompanying <code>LICENSE</code> file.</p>

<h2>Crates</h2>
<ul class="crates">
{{#each crates}}
  <li><code>{{package.name}} {{package.version}}</code> <span class="spdx">&mdash; {{package.license}}</span></li>
{{/each}}
</ul>

<h2>License Texts</h2>
{{#each licenses}}
{{#if first_of_kind}}
<h3>{{name}} <span class="spdx">({{id}})</span></h3>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/if}}
{{/each}}

</body>
</html>
